<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Installation / Despatch: &nbsp;</span></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">The stretcher is to be installed at (port code) on QF/XXX&nbsp; (from port codes to) aircraft rego VH-** departing at (00.00 24hrs) for passenger use on QF/XXX&nbsp; (from port codes to) aircraft rego VH-** departing at (00.00 24hrs)</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><b>OR//</b></span></span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp; (DELETE IF NOT APPLICABLE)</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">The stretcher is to be consigned as Cargo on QF/XXX (date) for passenger use on QF/XXX&nbsp; (from too port codes) aircraft registration VH-XXX departing at (00.00 24hrs)</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Removal of Stretcher:</span></b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Stretcher to be removed on arrival at:</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Stretcher must have a removal form raised IAW 3-25-020 and be returned to Sydney Distribution Centre for service and repair.</span></span><br />
<br />
<b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:red">NOTES:</span></span></b></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Engineering:</span></b><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Install I.A.W. Controlled Report Numbers: A330-C5481, A380-C6082, B737-GEND41, B789-C7366</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Airports:</span></b> &nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Ensure Cabin and Tech crews briefed of Stretcher passenger. </span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Crew to exercise caution when wheeling Galley Carts past MEDA pax.</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">All soiled linen to be handed to Stretcher Escort.</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Ensure no QF equipment leaves the aircraft.<br />
Escort to complete all documentation for stretcher passenger.</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Airport Operations to ensure Customs have been notified of Ambulance at Departure and Arrival ports.</span></span></span><br />
